                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "import org.springframework.ui.set\n\n@Controller\n@RequestMapping(\"/pets\")\nclass EditPetForm {\n\n\t// ...\n\n\t@GetMapping\n\tfun setupForm(@RequestParam(\"petId\") petId: Int, model: Model): String { "
