      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "By default, method parameters that use this annotation are required, but you can specify that a method parameter is optional by setting the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@RequestParam"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " annotation’s "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "required"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " flag to "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "false"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " or by declaring the argument with a "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "java.util.Optional"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " wrapper."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Type conversion is automatically applied if the target method parameter type is not "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "String"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ". See "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Type Conversion"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "web/webmvc/mvc-controller/ann-methods/typeconversion.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Declaring the argument type as an array or list allows for resolving multiple parameter values for the same parameter name."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "When an "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@RequestParam"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " annotation is declared as a "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Map<String, String>"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " or "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "MultiValueMap<String, String>"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", without a parameter name specified in the annotation, then the map is populated with the request parameter values for each given parameter name. The following example shows how to do so with form data processing:"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "dlist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
